e-med-koreansk-panering-krispig-kryddig-och-riktigt-lacker-fid-1613793"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="da" href="https://www.petitchef.dk/opskrifter/hovedret/kyllingeburger-med-koreansk-panering-sprod-krydret-og-virkelig-laekker-fid-1613794"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="hu" href="https://www.petitchef.hu/receptek/foetel/koreai-modra-panirozott-csirke-burger-ropogos-fuszeres-es-rendkivul-inycsiklando-fid-1613795"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="el" href="https://www.petitchef.gr/syntages/kyrios-piata/mpernker-me-kotopoulo-panarismeno-koreatikou-typou-tragano-pikantiko-kai-exairetika-lachtaristo-fid-1613796"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="sk" href="https://www.petitchef.sk/recepty/hlavne-jedla/burger-s-kuracim-masom-obalenym-v-korejskom-style-chrumkavy-pikantny-a-mimoriadne-lahodny-fid-1613797"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://en.petitchef.com/recipes/main-dish/korean-style-crispy-chicken-burger-with-spicy-sauce-fid-1614013"><link rel="manifest" href="/upload_data/manifest/manifest-en.json">

