				<section id="rd-steps"><h2 id="ref-steps" class="title">Preparation</h2><div class="rd-times"><div class="rdt-item"><i>Preparation</i>10 min</div><div class="rdt-item"><i>Cook time</i>10 min</div></div><ul class="rd-steps"><li><span class="step-img iw-zoom"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/imgupl/recipe-step/md-502508s2374360.jpg" width="200" height="150" alt="Korean-style crispy chicken burger with spicy sauce - Preparation step 1"></span>Cook the breaded chicken tender for the time indicated on the package. I cooked this one for 10 minutes in the air fryer at 390°F/200°C.</li><li><span class="step-img iw-zoom"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/imgupl/recipe-step/md-502508s2374361.jpg" width="200" height="150" alt="Korean-style crispy chicken burger with spicy sauce - Preparation step 2"></span>Toast the burger buns for 2 minutes in a toaster (or 2 minutes in an air fryer at 370°F/190°C).<br clear="all"> 			<div id="div-gpt-ad-PC_mobile_336x280_1-0" style="min-width:336px;min-height:300px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align:center; "></div></li><li><span class="step-img iw-zoom"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/imgupl/recipe-step/md-502508s2374362.jpg" width="200" height="150" alt="Korean-style crispy chicken burger with spicy sauce - Preparation step 3"></span>Prepare the sauce by mixing together the mayonnaise, soy sauce, honey, minced garlic, gochujang, sesame seeds, and sesame oil.</li><li><span class="step-img iw-zoom"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/imgupl/recipe-step/md-502508s2374363.jpg" width="200" height="150" alt="Korean-style crispy chicken burger with spicy sauce - Preparation step 4"></span>Spread the sauce over the entire surface of the bread base.<br clear="all"> 			<div id="div-gpt-ad-PC_mobile_336x280_2-0" style="min-width:336px;min-height:300px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align:center; "></div></li><li><span class="step-img iw-zoom"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/imgupl/recipe-step/md-502508s2374364.jpg" width="200" height="150" alt="Korean-style crispy chicken burger with spicy sauce - Preparation step 5"></span>Add the cheese on top. Then place the breaded chicken on top.</li><li><span class="step-img iw-zoom"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/imgupl/recipe-step/md-502508s2374365.jpg" width="200" height="150" alt="Korean-style crispy chicken burger with spicy sauce - Preparation step 6"></span>Add the lettuce leaves (you can also chop the lettuce finely if you like). Scatter the kimchi pieces on top.<br clear="all"> 			<div id="div-gpt-ad-PC_mobile_336x280_3-0" style="min-width:336px;min-height:300px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align:center; "></div></li><li><span class="step-img iw-zoom"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/imgupl/recipe-step/md-502508s2374366.jpg" width="200" height="150" alt="Korean-style crispy chicken burger with spicy sauce - Preparation step 7"></span>Finish by adding the top half of the burger bun, spread with sauce... and it's ready!</li></ul></section><section id="vote-comments-just-from" class="vote-comments" data-table-name="feed_data" data-table-id="1614013" data-table-member-id="510842" data-table-member-username="PetitChef_Official" data-table-member-photo="/imgupl/member/xs-510842.jpg" data-comment-photo-enabled="1" aria-label="Rating / Comments"><h2 class="title" data-count="">Rate this recipe</h2><div class="vc-form" data-table="feed_data" data-id="1614013" data-rate-hint1="Not good" data-rate-hint2="so so" data-rate-hint3="Good" data-rate-hint4="Very good" data-rate-hint5="Excellent !!!">
